      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• worktree per repo, branch = feature name\n• writes .context/: feature.json, state.json (PRs),\n   comments: f is the ONLY writer\n• PRs + CI from GitHub; f sync after merges\n• remove → trash (f restore, 14 days)\n• launchd: f sync --all every 30 min for pr status",
      "originalText": "• worktree per repo, branch = feature name\n• writes .context/: feature.json, state.json (PRs),\n   comments: f is the ONLY writer\n• PRs + CI from GitHub; f sync after merges\n• remove → trash (f restore, 14 days)\n• launchd: f sync --all every 30 min for pr status",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
